description.content:
Creates, updates, or deletes multiple part uses for the **work order + asset** pair.
             • Supports both refrigerant and non-refrigerant parts. 
             • Supports inventory and vendor-supplied parts.
            <br />**Example request for removing part use records:**
            
               { 
                "DeleteItems": [
                { 
                    "PartId": 58069830,
                    "DeletionReason": "Incorrect Quantity",
                    "InventoryPartId": 80467,
                    "IsInventoryPart": true
                },
                { 
                    "PartId": 58069831,
                    "DeletionReason": "Wrong Part",
                    "IsInventoryPart": false
                }
               ]
               }
